13: |---------------------|---------------------|-----------|--------------------------------------------------|
14: | Qwen3-Coder (30B-A3B)| `qwen-coder.service`| 18080     | llama.cpp, OpenAI-compatible `/v1`               |
15: | PostgreSQL + pgvector| `postgres.service` | 15432     | `aigents` database, schema seeded on first boot  |
