132:   `HealthStartPeriod` + `HealthRetries` instead.
133: - **`[Container]` is parsed as a map**, so repeated `Exec=` keys collapse to the
134:   last one. The whole llama-server command line is assembled in `main.tf` and
135:   emitted as a single `Exec=`.
136: - **Podman's `podman-user-wait-network-online.service` helper stalls every
137:   container start on this host.** Podman adds `Wants=`/`After=` on that helper to
138:   every Quadlet unit, and its `ExecStart` is a poll loop —
139:   `until systemctl is-active network-online.target; do sleep 0.5; done` — with
