143:   `full` connectivity, and `nm-online -s -q` returns in milliseconds — it is
144:   specifically the `network-online.target` unit that never activates (starting
145:   it manually times out). A drop-in overriding the helper to `/bin/true` is
146:   installed when `skip_network_online_wait = true`. Set it to `false` on a host
147:   where the target does activate.
