9: 
10: ## What it runs
11: 
12: | Service             | Unit               | Host port | Notes                                            |
13: |---------------------|---------------------- |-----------|--------------------------------------------------|
14: | Phi-4 (14B)         | `phi-4.service`      | 18080     | llama.cpp, OpenAI-compatible `/v1`               |
15: | PostgreSQL + pgvector| `postgres.service` | 15432     | `aigents` database, schema seeded on first boot  |
16: | Qdrant              | `qdrant.service`    | 16333 / 16334 | HTTP / gRPC, API key enforced on data endpoints |
17: 
18: `model-fetch.service` is a one-shot unit that downloads the GGUF weights; it is
19: not enabled at boot.
