92: 
93: Any GGUF works — override the repo and file:
94: 
95: ```sh
96: tofu apply \
97:   -var 'model_repo=Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF' \
98:   -var 'model_file=Qwen3-0.6B-Q8_0.gguf' \
