111: **`model_api_key` is empty by default, and llama-server's own CORS policy
112: allows every origin.** That is only acceptable because the published port binds
113: to loopback. Before setting `bind_address = "0.0.0.0"`:
114: 
115: ```sh
116: tofu apply -var 'model_api_key=<bearer-token>'
117: ```
